002E                  (            scf.d):00084         IT.WND              RMB       1                   Window number (matches device name) ($2E)
002F                  (            scf.d):00085         IT.VAL              RMB       1                   Use defaults on Init (0=no, 1=yes)
0030                  (            scf.d):00086         IT.STY              RMB       1                   Screen type default
0031                  (            scf.d):00087         IT.CPX              RMB       1                   Column start default
0032                  (            scf.d):00088         IT.CPY              RMB       1                   Row start default
