                      (       cocovtio.d):00157         * Unknown for now
                      (       cocovtio.d):00158         *VD.FFMem rmb   2  (2) bottom of stack for flood fill
                      (       cocovtio.d):00159         *VD.FFSPt rmb   2  (2) flood fill stack pointer
                      (       cocovtio.d):00160         *VD.FFSTp rmb   2  (2) flood fill stack top pointer
                      (       cocovtio.d):00161         *VD.FF6   rmb   1   flood fill flag
                      (       cocovtio.d):00162         *VD.MCol2 rmb   1  color
                      (       cocovtio.d):00163         *VD.FF1   rmb   1  data for flood fill
                      (       cocovtio.d):00164         *VD.FF2   rmb   1  data for flood fill
                      (       cocovtio.d):00165         *VD.FFMsk rmb   1  flood fill mask
                      (       cocovtio.d):00166         *VD.FFFlg rmb   1  flood fill flag
                      (       cocovtio.d):00167         *VD.Palet rmb   16 (16) current palette values
                      (       cocovtio.d):00168         *VD.PlFlg rmb   1  initialized to $08 by L00DB, and then unused!
