0008                  (       cocovtio.d):00954         Gt.BClr             RMB       1                   Background color                               $08
0009                  (       cocovtio.d):00955         Gt.FMsk             RMB       1                   Foreground mask                                $09
000A                  (       cocovtio.d):00956         Gt.BMsk             RMB       1                   Background mask                                $0A
000B                  (       cocovtio.d):00957         Gt.GBlk             RMB       1                   Block # of graphics cursor                     $0B
